[I] Command-line tool for everything at Exoscale

[T] exoscale is a tool to manage your Exoscale infrastructure easily from the
[T] command-line with exo.

[U] https://github.com/exoscale/cli

[A] Exoscale Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS
[R] + arm arm64 loongarch64 mips mips64 powerpc64 riscv64 s390x x86 x86-64

[L] APL
[V] 1.103.2

[D] 723108e22bd15e5e3512b72b8e20a0dd6b68f5ef6c2959703ae82fa0 exoscale-cli-1.103.2.tar.gz https://github.com/exoscale/cli/archive/refs/tags/v1.103.2/

. $base/package/*/*/go-conf.in

hook_add postmake 5 "install -v cli $root$bindir/exo"
